sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant WAF as AWS WAF
    participant API as API Gateway (prod)
    participant Cache as Stage Cache (300s)
    participant Cognito as Cognito User Pool
    participant Lambda as Lambda SaveOrder
    participant DDB as DynamoDB Global Table

    Note over Client,DDB: Create an order — POST /orders

    Client->>WAF: POST /orders + JWT + body
    WAF->>WAF: Rate check (1000 / 5 min per IP)
    alt rate limit exceeded
        WAF-->>Client: 403 Blocked
    else within limit
        WAF->>API: Forward request
        API->>Cognito: Validate JWT
        alt token invalid
            Cognito-->>API: Unauthorized
            API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        else token valid
            Cognito-->>API: Claims OK
            API->>Lambda: Invoke (proxy integration)
            Lambda->>Lambda: Validate orderId & itemId
            Lambda->>DDB: PutItem (write)
            DDB->>DDB: Replicate us-east-1 → us-west-2 (streams)
            DDB-->>Lambda: Write OK
            Lambda-->>API: 201 Created
            API-->>Client: 201 { order saved }
        end
    end

    Note over Client,DDB: Read an order — GET /orders/{orderId}

    Client->>WAF: GET /orders/123 + JWT
    WAF->>API: Forward request
    API->>Cognito: Validate JWT
    Cognito-->>API: Claims OK
    alt response cached (within 300s TTL)
        API->>Cache: Lookup
        Cache-->>Client: 200 cached result (no backend call)
    else cache miss
        API->>DDB: Query via IAM role (direct integration, no Lambda)
        DDB-->>API: Items
        API->>API: Response mapping template → clean JSON
        API->>Cache: Store for 300s
        API-->>Client: 200 { orders }
    end
